 <h3><u>Abbas tera haq hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Abbas, Abbas, Abbas..(2)<br> Abbas tera haq hai zamana tujhe roye..(2)<br> jab shaam o sahar fatima zahra tujhe roye<br> Abbas tera haq hai zamana tujhe roye..(2)<br> Haye abbas..</p> 
  <p>1. Durra liye pehre pe sitamgaar khada hai..(2)<br> kaise tere laashe pe sakina tujhe roye..(2)<br> Abbas tera..</p> 
  <p>2. Jis waqt uthaya na gaya laasha jawa'n ka..(2)<br> sheh us ghadi akbar se zyaada tujhe roye..(2)<br> Abbas tera..</p> 
  <p>3. Zainab ne kaha shame ghareeba mein aye ghaazi..(2)<br> be parda mujhe dekhke baba tujhe roye..(2)<br> Abbas tera..</p> 
  <p>4. Sajde ke liye jab liya haatho ka sahara..(2)<br> to sajjad musalle pe hamesha tujhe roye<br> Abbas tera..</p> 
  <p>5. Bin haath ke kis tarha tu ghode se gira tha..(2)<br> ye sunke bohot ehle madina tujhe roye..(2)<br> Abbas tera..</p> 
  <p>6. Mashkiza kahi'n, jism kahi'n, haath kahi'n hai<br> jaa jaa ke kaha'n fatima zahra tujhe roye..(2)<br> Abbas tera..</p> 
  <p>7. Armaan sakina ka tha jitna tujhe roti..(2)<br> sajjad teri qabr pe utna tujhe roye..(2)<br> Abbas tera..</p> 
  <p>8. Hashim ke qamar kyu na tera chaahne wala...(2)<br> wa-sh- shams ka padte hue sura tujhe roye..(2)<br> Abbas tera..</p> 
  <p>9. Hasrat hai ke ghazi ho lahu aankh se jaari..(2)<br> ye mir takallum kabhi aisa tujhe roye<br> jab sham o sahar fatima zahra tujhe roye<br> Abbas tera..<br> haye abbas....</p> 
